# CodeGuard AI Environment Configuration
# 
# This project uses separate environment files for backend and frontend.
# Copy the appropriate .env.example file in each subdirectory:
#
# Backend:  cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
# Frontend: cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#
# See backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for all available options.

# Backend Environment Variables (configure in backend/.env):
# - GITHUB_TOKEN: GitHub Personal Access Token
# - AI_PROVIDER: gemini | nvidia | mock
# - AI_API_KEY: API key for AI provider
# - DATABASE_URL: PostgreSQL connection string (or use default SQLite)
# - PORT, HOST, ENVIRONMENT: Server settings

# Frontend Environment Variables (configure in frontend/.env):
# - VITE_API_BASE_URL: Backend API URL (default: http://localhost:8000)